# Recognised history for the libvirt identities above (reconcile-only,
# never auto-migrated): pre-packaging hosts hand-provisioned a local
# kvm:994 group before the base seed carried kvm:160. Install stays
# blocked until `saphira-identity reconcile libvirt --apply` migrates,
# then `apk fix libvirt` converges.
#
# Deliberately NOT recorded: the hand-provisioned qemu:107 accounts on
# those same hosts. UID 107 is alfred's published identity since
# 2026-09-18 (renumber commit 116c097d, verified free at the time);
# hand-provisioned local accounts have no standing against the
# published record, so asserting 107 as qemu history was invalid and
# the repository gate refuses it. Those accounts are foreign squatters:
# remove them (after verifying no files need rechown) rather than
# migrating them; the packaged qemu:173 is created fresh.
legacy group kvm 994
